SUMMARY:Haywagon Tours at Norman Bird
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261019
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261020
DTSTAMP:20261019T170919Z
UID:f315f666a1985533def9dbcf6395@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Haywagon Tours at Norman Bird Sanctuary Date: Select dates fro
 m 3:00 to 5:00 PM Thursday\, October 15th Monday\, October 19th Wednesday
 \, October 21st Location: Norman Bird Sanctuary\, 583 Third Beach Road\, M
 iddletown\, RI 02842 Cost: Member $200 | Non-Member $250 (Cost is based on
  private group reservation for up to 15 people). Register Here! Two time s
 lots are available for reservation at 3:00 p.m. and 4:00 p.m. Round up you
 r family and friends for a 45-minute fall haywagon adventure at Norman Bir
 d Sanctuary! Gather your favorite people and climb aboard for a haywagon a
 dventure through the shrublands and open fields of Norman Bird Sanctuary. 
 Each reservation includes the entire haywagon\, so bring your family and f
 riends and enjoy the ride together as a private group of up to 15 people. 
 It’s a wonderful way to spend a crisp autumn day together and experience
  the Sanctuary from a different perspective. Bundle up and take in the cha
 nging landscape\, crisp autumn air\, and sights and sounds of the season a
 s you travel through the Sanctuary together.\n\nSource: https://www.visitr
 hodeisland.com/event/haywagon-tours-at-norman-bird/112328/
LOCATION:Norman Bird Sanctuary\, 583 Third Beach Road\, Middletown\, RI 02
 842 Cost: Member $200 | Non-Member $250 (Cost is based on private group re
 servation for up to 15 people). Register Here! Two time slots are availabl
 e for reservation at 3:00 p.m. and 4:00 p.m. Round up your family and frie
 nds for a 45-minute fall haywagon adventure at Norman Bird Sanctuary! Gath
 er your favorite people and climb aboard for a haywagon adventure through 
 the shrublands and open fields of Norman Bird Sanctuary. Each reservation 
 includes the entire haywagon\, so bring your family and friends and enjoy 
 the ride together as a private group of up to 15 people. It’s a wonderfu
 l way to spend a crisp autumn day together and experience the Sanctuary fr
 om a different perspective. Bundle up and take in the changing landscape\,
  crisp autumn air\, and sights and sounds of the season as you travel thro
 ugh the Sanctuary together. Show More View Website | Email 1 / 1 Additiona
 l Information\, 583 Third Beach Road\, Middletown\, RI 02842
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/haywagon-tours-at-norman-bird/1
 12328/
END:VEVENT
